  "value": {
   "reference": "simulate every minute of the day, counting the paid orders ongoing in that minute and its weight",
   "candidate_design": "sweep the rows once with a running count of ongoing paid orders; between consecutive row times add 30 * count * (W(t) - W(previous)), where W(t) is the closed-form weighted minute count before t with peak minutes weighted 2; a first pass marks cancelled orders, which never enter the count",
